        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-18>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-19>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-20>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-21>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-22>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-058-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-058-23>,
